Description: IULinux desktop integration
 Provides the supported IULinux Plasma desktop integration, including the
 IULinux global theme and panel layout, desktop defaults, IULinux Settings,
 performance and graphics integration, Ptyxis and Resources defaults, and required Plasma
 widgets.
